<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Your love is like a rushing wave, constraining me</l><l>To love You with my very life, no longer free.</l><l>O Lord, keep me ever in Your love; Your Word keep empowering me</l><l>To love You in body, soul, and strength, with my whole being.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
